@C.PASS1
Syntax: C.Pass1 [<opts>] <file>
Usage : C compiler first pass - parse and build intermediate code
Opts  :
  -o=<file>  write output to <file> (default: standard output)
  -s         strip symbol information from the output
  -p         emit profiling information
Note  : reads preprocessed C from c.prep and writes intermediate code
        for c.pass2.  Normally run by CC1, not directly.
